
### ES-INTRO-01 健康检查 /_cluster/health是Elasticsearch 官方已经定义好的“查看集群健康状态”的接口。
GET http://127.0.0.1:9200/_cluster/health?wait_for_status=yellow&timeout=30s

### ES-INTRO-02 观察标准分析器    /_analyze是 ES 自带的“分析一段文字”只展示分析结果，不保存文档的接口
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/_analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "analyzer": "standard",
  "text": "OPS2026"
}

### ES-INTRO-03 创建文字通知索引  PUT /kb_es_intro_v1创建一个名为 kb_es_intro_v1 的索引
PUT http://127.0.0.1:9200/kb_es_intro_v1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mappings": {
    "dynamic": "strict",
    "properties": {
      "title": {"type": "text"},
      "text": {"type": "text"},
      "visibility": {"type": "keyword"}
    }
  }
}

### ES-INTRO-04 写入公开通知
PUT http://127.0.0.1:9200/kb_es_intro_v1/_doc/1?refresh=wait_for
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "项目上线公告",
  "text": "项目代号 OPS2026 将在周五进行公开演示。",
  "visibility": "public"
}

### ES-INTRO-05 写入内部通知
PUT http://127.0.0.1:9200/kb_es_intro_v1/_doc/2?refresh=wait_for
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "项目内部安排",
  "text": "项目代号 OPS2026 的内部演练安排在周四下午完成。",
  "visibility": "internal"
}

### ES-INTRO-06 写入另一条公开通知
PUT http://127.0.0.1:9200/kb_es_intro_v1/_doc/3?refresh=wait_for
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "培训通知",
  "text": "项目代号 HR2026 的新员工培训安排在下周一。",
  "visibility": "public"
}

### ES-INTRO-07 全文搜索 OPS2026
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/kb_es_intro_v1/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 10,
  "query": {
    "match": {
      "text": "OPS2026"
    }
  }
}

### ES-INTRO-08 全文搜索加公开过滤
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/kb_es_intro_v1/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 10,
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "match": {
            "text": "OPS2026"
          }
        }
      ],
      "filter": [
        {
          "term": {
            "visibility": "public"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}

### ES-INTRO-09 搜索另一个项目编号
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/kb_es_intro_v1/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 10,
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "match": {
            "text": "HR2026"
          }
        }
      ],
      "filter": [
        {
          "term": {
            "visibility": "public"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}

